     [38;5;246mOne event type, one channel, minimal tasks+identity, end-to-end. Then widen. Notification constraints shape the [39m
     [38;5;246mlower layers while they're cheap to change.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Layered, bottom-up
     [38;5;246mTasks → identity → subscriptions → notifications, each complete before the next. Clean specs, but nothing demoable
[39m     [38;5;246muntil the end.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Notifications spec first
